    "git": "operations is an array of objects with op. status/current_branch/branches need only op; log allows ref,max_entries,paths; show requires ref; diff_refs requires from,to; diff_ref_worktree requires ref; switch requires branch and native clean-worktree authorization. Do not invent Git commands.",
