    "ida": "Same native contract as decompile.",
    "ghidra": "Same native contract as decompile.",
    "database_select": "Use structured native SQL AST objects, never raw SQL. select items have expr and optional alias; from is a native table/subquery source; joins contain source and on except CROSS; order_by contains expr and direction. Consult the native database schema before complex expressions.",
